                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl hidden md:block">➔</div>
                        <div class="p-4 border-2 border-black bg-zinc-900 text-white w-full md:w-1/3 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]">
                            <span class="font-bold block text-yellow-300">CORE PROCESSING (IA)</span>
                            <p class="text-[11px] mt-1 opacity-80">Random Forest Regressor predice demanda base ➔ Algoritmo descuenta inventario por mililitros y gramos exactos.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl hidden md:block">➔</div>
                        <div class="p-4 border border-dashed border-black/30 bg-zinc-50 w-full md:w-1/4">
                            <span class="font-bold block text-green-600">FINANCIAL OUTPUT</span>
                            <p class="text-[11px] mt-1 text-zinc-600">Márgenes Brutos en $ + Alerta de Mermas y Orden de Compra Automática</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-20 md:mt-32 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0 border-4 border-black overflow-hidden bg-white shadow-[10px_10px_0px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]">
            <div class="lg:col-span-4 p-8 md:p-10 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r-4 border-black hover:bg-[#FF3E00] hover:text-white transition-all group cursor-pointer">
